=== and to the SPECIES, which is what apply_recipe does at generation ===

--- recipe PAIRING (2 actions): ['LOSE_RADICAL', 'GAIN_PAIR']
    Ar+            -> 1 *1 Ar u0 p4 c0   isomorphic to ground-state Ar? True
    He+            -> 1 *1 He u0 p1 c0
    Ne+            -> 1 *1 Ne u0 p4 c0
    Ar  (neutral)  -> ActionError: Unable to update Atom due to LOSE_RADICAL action: Invalid radical electron set "-1".
    Li+            -> ActionError: Unable to update Atom due to LOSE_RADICAL action: Invalid radical electron set "-1".

--- recipe PAIRING (3 actions): ['LOSE_RADICAL', 'GAIN_PAIR', 'LOSE_CHARGE']
    Ar+            -> 1 *1 Ar u0 p4 c0   isomorphic to ground-state Ar? True
    He+            -> 1 *1 He u0 p1 c0
    Ne+            -> 1 *1 Ne u0 p4 c0
    Ar  (neutral)  -> ActionError: Unable to update Atom due to LOSE_RADICAL action: Invalid radical electron set "-1".
    Li+            -> ActionError: Unable to update Atom due to LOSE_RADICAL action: Invalid radical electron set "-1".


